 "punch": "FRIEND",
 "sentences": [
  {
   "slot": "S1",
   "text": "Why does one of these terrifying night creatures act almost like a friend?",
   "kind": "HOOK",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "creatures",
     "to": "owls"
    },
    {
     "on": "friend",
     "to": "man_head"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "S2",
   "text": "This is The Sleep of Reason Produces Monsters, engraved by Francisco Goya in 1799.",
   "kind": "FACT",
   "source": 18
  },
  {
   "slot": "S3",
   "text": "A man sleeps at his desk while owls and a lynx crowd in behind him.",
   "kind": "LOOK",
   "source": 3,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "man",
     "to": "man"
    },
    {
     "on": "desk",
     "to": "desk"
    },
    {
     "on": "owls",
     "to": "owls"
    },
    {
     "on": "lynx",
     "to": "lynx"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "S4",
   "text": "But look at the owl.",
   "kind": "LOOK",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "owl",
     "to": "owl_stylus"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "S5",
   "text": "It holds a stylus out to him.",
   "kind": "LOOK",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "stylus",
     "to": "owl_stylus"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "S6",
   "text": "The owl doesn't bite.",
   "kind": "LOOK",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "owl",
     "to": "owl_stylus"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "S6",
   "text": "The owl doesn't scream.",
   "kind": "LOOK",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "owl",
     "to": "owl_stylus"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "S6",
   "text": "The owl simply offers.",
   "kind": "LOOK",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "owl",
     "to": "owl_stylus"
    },
    {
     "on": "offers",
     "to": "owl_stylus"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "S7",
   "text": "According to Goya's own caption, fantasy abandoned by reason produced impossible monsters.",
   "kind": "FACT",
   "source": 15,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "monsters",
     "to": "main_action"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "S8",
   "text": "Monsters should come to destroy the dreamer.",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "Monsters",
     "to": "main_action"
    },
    {
     "on": "dreamer",
     "to": "man"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "S9",
   "text": "But united with reason, fantasy was the mother of arts.",
   "kind": "FACT",
   "source": 15,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "fantasy",
     "to": "owl_stylus"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "S10",
   "text": "And here's the disturbing part.",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null
  },
  {
   "slot": "S11",
   "text": "The creatures surround a sleeping man, yet one hands him his tool.",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "creatures",
     "to": "main_action"
    },
    {
     "on": "man",
     "to": "man"
    },
    {
     "on": "tool",
     "to": "owl_stylus"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "S12",
   "text": "As if the nightmare wants him to keep drawing.",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "drawing",
     "to": "owl_stylus"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "S13",
   "text": "So what is the owl asking him to draw?",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null,
